    {
      "source": "<code>requestCallback</code> - a function that prepares and writes to the request,\nreturning a publisher that signals when it's done writing.\nImplementations can return a <code>Mono&lt;Void&gt;</code> by calling\n<a href=\"../../ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#writeWith(org.reactivestreams.Publisher)\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.writeWith(Publisher)</code></a> or <a href=\"../../ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#setComplete()\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.setComplete()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>requestCallback</code> - 一个准备并向请求写入数据的函数，返回一个在写入完成时发出信号的 Publisher。实现可以通过调用 <a href=\"../../ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#writeWith(org.reactivestreams.Publisher)\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.writeWith(Publisher)</code></a> 或 <a href=\"../../ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#setComplete()\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.setComplete()</code></a> 返回一个 <code>Mono&lt;Void&gt;</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
